  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::UIAnimLab.Station
  Code: P8
  Title: Kill On Disable
  Summary: Each square spins slowly (8 s per turn). Turning it off with Kill On Disable
    on stops its animation; off lets it carry on unseen.
  Watch: Killed, Kept
  WatchObjects:
  - {fileID: 166905991}
  - {fileID: 6782951}
  HowTo: In play mode, wait a moment, toggle both off, wait 2 seconds, toggle both
    on.
  Expect: Killed comes back standing still where it was (its spin ended; it plays
    again only when told). Kept comes back further round, still spinning - it carried
    on while hidden.
  Needs: 2
  Style: 0
  WikiPage: 
  Capture: 
  Width: 620
  StageHeight: 260
