  Title: Completing runs Set Active, not sounds
  Summary: Deliver moves the box (3 s), then plays a coin sound and turns the badge
    on.
  Watch: Box, Badge
  WatchObjects:
  - {fileID: 38789242}
  - {fileID: 1665244365}
  HowTo: 'In play mode: Deliver and let it finish. Reset. Deliver, then Stop(complete)
    half way.'
  Expect: 'Finishing on its own: coin sound, then the tick. Stop(complete): the box
    jumps to the end and the tick appears, with no coin sound.'
