  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::UIAnimLab.Station
  Code: P3
  Title: Interrupt Others unticked
  Summary: A looping pulse that plays on top of other animations, because its Interrupt
    Others is unticked - and theirs decides whether it survives them.
  Watch: Icon
  WatchObjects:
  - {fileID: 191313842}
  HowTo: 'In play mode: Pulse, then Spin. Then Spin + stop others. Then Pulse again
    and Stop Pulse.'
  Expect: Spin (unticked) turns the star while it keeps pulsing. Spin + stop others
    (ticked, STOP) stops the pulse where it stands, then spins. Stop Pulse stops
    it through StopAnimation.
  Needs: 2
  Style: 0
  WikiPage: 
  Capture: 
  Width: 620
  StageHeight: 260
