  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::UIAnimLab.Station
  Code: P5
  Title: Punch and shake spam
  Summary: A punch or shake cut short is put back where it started, so spamming one
    never drifts.
  Watch: Box, the scale readout
  WatchObjects:
  - {fileID: 818094029}
  - {fileID: 799251959}
  HowTo: In play mode, click Squish and Jelly as fast as you can, then the two Spam
    buttons (20 plays, 50 ms apart), alternating. Also mash Play in the preview.
  Expect: When everything settles the readout says exactly 1.000, 1.000, every time.
  Needs: 3
